1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,500
If you touch the back of your neck right now...

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,000
notice how tightly it's holding on.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,800
Interlace your fingers behind your head.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:20,500
Let your hands take the full weight of your skull.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,200
Keep your face looking forward.

6
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,200
Now gently look to the right. Just your eyes.

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Keep your eyes there. Don't push.

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,500
Just wait for your body to sigh, swallow, or soften.

9
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,000
[ Exhale & Release ]

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,500
Bring your eyes back to center.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,500
Feel that quiet drop.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:47,500
You are the stillness watching your body let go.

